---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy"
  description="How Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy collects, uses, and protects your personal information, in line with South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA)."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="pt-40 pb-16 bg-brand-dark relative overflow-hidden" style="padding-top: 10rem;">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-brand-blue/5 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6">PRIVACY <span class="text-brand-blue">POLICY</span></h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-6">
                How we collect, use, and protect your personal information.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="py-16 bg-brand-black">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Effective date: 30 August 2026</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Who we are</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy ("Velokhaya", "we", "us") is a registered non-profit organisation
                based at 40 Makabeni Road, Village 1 North, Khayelitsha, Cape Town, 7784, South Africa.
                We are the responsible party for personal information processed through this website, as
                contemplated by the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA).
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                For any privacy-related questions or requests, contact us at
                <a href="mailto:sipho@velokhaya.com" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">sipho@velokhaya.com</a>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">2. Information we collect</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 space-y-2">
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-white">Information you send us.</strong> When you contact us by email, phone,
                    or through the contact form on this site (which opens a message in your own email application),
                    we receive the details you choose to share — typically your name, email address, and the content
                    of your message.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-white">Usage information (only with your consent).</strong> If you accept
                    analytics cookies, we collect information about how you use this website — pages viewed,
                    interactions with page elements, approximate location derived from your IP address, device and
                    browser type, and web performance measurements.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                This website does not offer user accounts and does not ask you to submit payment details, identity
                numbers, or other special personal information.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">3. How we use your information</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 space-y-2">
                <li>To respond to your enquiries and correspond with you.</li>
                <li>To understand how the website is used and improve it.</li>
                <li>To administer partnerships, donations, and other support you offer us.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">4. Cookies and analytics</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                When you first visit, we ask for your consent before loading any analytics. Essential storage
                (remembering your cookie choice) is always used; analytics run only if you choose
                "Accept All" or enable analytics under "Manage Preferences".
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Our analytics are provided by Amplitude, configured to store and process data in the European Union.
                Amplitude sets cookies and collects the usage information described above. You can withdraw or change
                your consent at any time via the <strong class="text-white">Cookie Preferences</strong> link in the
                footer of every page.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">5. Third-party services</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 space-y-2">
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-white">Donations (Yoco).</strong> Card donations are processed on Yoco's
                    payment page, not on this website. We never see or store your card details. Yoco's own
                    <a href="https://www.yoco.com/za/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">privacy policy</a> applies to payments.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-white">Amplitude (EU).</strong> Analytics, as described above, only after
                    consent.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-white">Google Fonts.</strong> This site loads fonts from Google's servers,
                    which involves your browser sending your IP address to Google.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-white">External links.</strong> Links to social media platforms and map
                    services take you to third-party sites governed by their own privacy policies.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">6. Sharing of information</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                We do not sell personal information. We share it only with the service providers named above (to the
                extent they process it on our behalf), or where the law requires us to.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">7. Retention</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                We keep correspondence for as long as needed to deal with your enquiry and for our legitimate
                record-keeping. Analytics data is retained in line with Amplitude's retention settings and is not
                used to identify you personally.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">8. Your rights under POPIA</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, and
                to object to processing. To exercise these rights, email
                <a href="mailto:sipho@velokhaya.com" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">sipho@velokhaya.com</a>.
                If you are not satisfied with our response, you may lodge a complaint with the
                <a href="https://inforegulator.org.za/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">Information Regulator of South Africa</a>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">9. Children</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                This website is aimed at supporters, partners, and families — not at children. We do not knowingly
                collect personal information from children through this website. Information about our athletes is
                published only with appropriate consent.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">10. Security</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                The website is served over HTTPS, and we take reasonable technical and organisational measures to
                protect the personal information we hold.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">11. Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                We may update this policy from time to time. The effective date at the top shows when it was last
                revised; significant changes will be flagged on this page.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
